        "concept": "formal SBAR experience",
        "statement": "I am a member of the deteriorating-patient response team at my ICU, where we escalate according to NEWS2. On my surgical ward I coordinated the shifts for a 28-bed ward on nights. I do not have a specific SBAR example or a measurable outcome to quote, so I will not claim formal SBAR experience beyond that.",
