        "concept": "team of 32",
        "statement": "The largest scope I have coordinated is the shift coordination of a 28-bed surgical ward on nights, from June 2019 to August 2021. On my ICU I am a named nurse for one to two level-3 patients per shift, but I have not led a team of 32 or a whole unit. I have no further measurable outcome to add.",
