      {
        "date": "2026-10-12",
        "source": "interview",
        "concept": "independent ECMO circuit management",
        "statement": "On ECMO: my unit runs ECMO retrievals with a specialist team, and I have cared for ECMO patients alongside the perfusion-trained nurses - priming assistance, circuit observation and bedside care. But I have NOT independently managed an ECMO circuit and I am not ECMO-certified. On paediatric intensive care: No - I have no paediatric intensive care experience. All my ICU practice is with adults. That is an honest gap, and I would not want it recorded otherwise.",
