        "concept": "number of CRRT treatments supported",
        "statement": "Since September 2021 I have worked on the 18-bed Level 3 adult ICU at St. Aldate's NHS Trust in Leeds, where CRRT is part of my care of ventilated patients, alongside invasive monitoring (arterial/CVC) and vasoactive infusions. I am the named nurse for one to two level-3 patients per shift. I do not have figures for the number of CRRT treatments I have supported.",
